# Reviewed trivy findings for this repository. Each entry has a reason; remove an entry when its reason stops holding.

# DS002 (no USER instruction): by design. The entrypoint starts as root only to copy the two platform secret files
# into a private 0600 location, then runs every other command as uid 10001 through setpriv. The CI container job
# asserts that the server process runs as uid 10001.
DS002

# DS031 (secret in ENV): false positive. ROOTSENTINEL_AUDIT_KEY_FILE holds a file path, not key material; the key
# arrives at run time as a platform secret file and is never baked into the image.
DS031

# DS026 (no HEALTHCHECK): the hosting platform probes /health itself, and the Host allow-list means a generic
# in-container probe would need the public origin as its Host header.
DS026
